s/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-04T15:09:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-04T15:09:26Z","body":"> What is the Escape symbol even from?\r\n\r\nmacOS uses it, and it is defined in [ISO/IEC 9995-7](https://www.unicode.org/L2/L2011/11132-iso9995-7-2009.pdf).\r\n\r\n> It would be nice to have some in-between mode that shows the keys as they appear on keyboard \r\n\r\nIt might be worth adding as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3612711603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]